==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*orzčьtъ}}, from {{m|sla-pro|*čisti}}; synchronically analyzable as a deverbal form of {{af|ru|рас-|-читать}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-расчёт.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|adj=расчётный}}

# [[calculation]] (mathematical operation)
#: {{uxi|ru|'''расчёт''' [[масс]] [[микрочастица|микрочасти́ц]]|'''calculation''' of the mass of microparticles}}
# [[estimation]], [[expectation]], [[intention]], [[expectation]], [[assumption]], [[calculation]] (of a future event)
#: {{uxi|ru|'''расчёты''' [[на]] [[донорский|до́норское]] [[финанси́рование]]|'''expectations''' for donor funding}}
# {{lb|ru|finance}} [[payment]], [[settlement]] of accounts (compensation for purchased goods/services received)
# {{lb|ru|finance}} calculated amount for a [[termination]] [[payment]] / [[redundancy]] [[payout]] / [[severance]] [[package]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''расчёт''' [[выходно́го]] [[посо́бия]]|'''amount''' for a severance package}}
# [[settlement]] (process of determining a payment)
#: {{uxi|ru|[[оконча́тельный]] '''расчёт''' [[по]] [[сде́лке]]|the final '''settlement''' of a transaction}}
# [[consideration]], [[account]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[приня́ть]] [[в]] '''расчёт'''|to take into '''account'''/'''consideration'''}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[с]] [[таки́м]] '''расчётом'''|in such a way}}
# {{lb|ru|military unit}} {{topics|ru|Artillery}} [[gun]] [[crew]], [[gunner]]s {{gloss|group of soldiers operating an artillery piece, machine gun, etc.}}
# {{lb|ru|finance|in the plural}} [[payment]] (acts of transferring money)
#: {{uxi|ru|[[популярный|популя́рная]] [[фо́рма]] '''расчётов'''|a popular form of '''payment'''}}

====Declension====
{{ru-noun-table}}

====Synonyms====
* {{l|ru|вычисле́ние}}, {{l|ru|обсчитывание}}
* {{l|ru|наме́рение}}, {{l|ru|предположе́ние}}
* {{l|ru|вы́года}}, {{l|ru|по́льза}}, {{l|ru|интере́с}}, {{l|ru|коры́сть}}
* {{l|ru|упла́та}}

